      "account_name": "FX投機家@オフロードライダー",
      "bookmarks": 0,
      "content_en": "I introduced MT4 Speed Order. Since I run an EA I don't use it for entries, but I thought it was useful for checking the spread. The USDJPY spread is 0.4-0.6, so I don't think you need to watch it too strictly. The EURUSD spread was 0.5, so trading EURUSD is also a possibility. This is an HFM KATANA account.\nPeople who open an account through my ID get benefits such as cashback, bonuses and gifts.",
