    "2117361354629869975": {
      "account_followers": 10328,
      "account_handle": "flove_fxtrader",
      "account_name": "えふらぶ@FXトレーダー",
      "bookmarks": 0,
      "content_en": "This is a re-announcement of the Axi copy trading explainer article I published last month!\n\nTo become a signal provider you must submit a track record of 6 months or more, so the screening is strict unlike XM or HFM, but if you have already passed screening at something like TitanFX, which also uses Pelican Trading, you'll be accepted even without submitting! 【Table of contents 4-2】\n\nAlso, the signal I'm currently providing, \"Flove Shining Sunrise\", I still plan to continue for now! If the EA running on the Axi Select account changes, I might stop and restart with another EA, though...\n\nPlease take a look!",
      "content_original": "先月公開したAxiコピートレード解説記事の再告知です！\n\nシグナルプロバイダーになるには6ヶ月以上の実績の提出が必須なのでXMやHFMなどと違って審査が厳しいですが、同じくPelican Tradingを使ってるTitanFXなどで既に審査が通っていれば未提出でも受かります！【目次4-2】\n\n尚、シグナル提供中の「Flove Shining Sunrise」は一応まだ継続予定です！Axi Select口座で稼働するEAが変わってくればやめて別のEAで仕切り直しするかもしれませんが・・・\n\n是非ご覧ください！",
